\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Ye holy angels bright
\par Who wait at God's right hand,
\par Or through the realms of light
\par Fly at your Lord's command,
\par Assist our song,
\par Or else the theme
\par Too high doth seem
\par For mortal tongue.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Ye blessed soul at rest,
\par Who see your Saviour's face,
\par Whose glory, ev'n the least
\par Is far above our grace
\par God's praises sound,
\par As in His sight
\par With sweet delight
\par Ye do abound.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Ye saints, who toil below,
\par Adore your heavenly King,
\par And, onward as ye go,
\par Some joyful anthem sing;
\par Take what He gives,
\par And praise Him still
\par Through good and ill,
\par Who ever lives.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. My soul, bear thou thy part,
\par Triumph in God above,
\par And with a well-tuned heart
\par Sing thou the songs of love
\par Let all thy days
\par Till life shall end,
\par Whate'er He send,
\par Be filled with praise.
\par                   Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

